
  Approve setup in your browser

  Approve each request in the setup tab.
  The next request opens in the same tab.

  ⣽ Cloudflare: Authorize
    On the Cloudflare page, turn on API Tokens Write
    under Sensitive scopes, and then select Authorize.
    Cloudflare leaves API Tokens Write off, and setup
    needs it to create your site's deploy key.
  ○ GitHub: Create
  ○ GitHub: Install & Authorize
  ○ GitHub: Approve

  If no tab opened, go to
  http://127.0.0.1:49152/?k=5f0
  c9e2a7b4d4e1f8a3c6b9d0e2f4a71

  To resume, run cairn new again.

  Ctrl+C stop